  "name": "rust-cc",
  "description": "A primitive cycle collector for Rust that provides a trait-based mechanism for breaking reference cycles in reference-counted pointer graphs. It implements a depth-first search algorithm to traverse object graphs via user-defined reference enumeration and provides a manual collection trigger to resolve leaks in 'Rc' and 'RefCell' based structures.",
